Z||000003||Black88GT||01-02-2001||09:30 PM||||I have found many many many good thinks at "junk"yards.  I found an 88 coupe with beechwood interior once, a guy in my club found an 87 GT with mint body parts that he used for a fastback conversion on his 86 SE, costed him 100 bucks for everything.<P>The thing is, hoods are so big no one will want to ship one to you.  You would probably have to call Ed Parks or Kick Hill.<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD||||reg||1
