Z||000011||Black88GT||01-03-2001||03:45 PM||||What do you think Ed Parks is? <P>A hood is a hood.  You think you will get a junk yard plague or something?  Do you think someone will sell you a hood off of their running Fiero?<P>I mean c'mon, you will probably pay as much in shipping as you will for the hood itself, call Ed Parks if you don't believe me.<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD||||reg||1
